beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from houdini (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-houdini-beta-2\">Publish from Houdini (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from solidworks (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-solidworks-beta-2\">Publish from SolidWorks (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from spline, and figma (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-spline-and-figma-beta-2\">Publish from Spline, and Figma (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"camera paths and default walkthroughs\" href=\"/docs/guides/camera-paths\" id=\"lnk-camera-paths-and-default-walkthroughs-2\">Camera paths and default walkthroughs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"hotspots and doors\" href=\"/docs/guides/hotspots-and-doors\" id=\"lnk-hotspots-and-doors-2\">Hotspots and doors</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse capture: film a room (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/film-a-room\" id=\"lnk-verse-capture-film-a-room-beta-2\">Verse Capture: film a room (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse play: host a web game\" href=\"/docs/guides/host-a-web-game\" id=\"lnk-verse-play-host-a-web-game-2\">Verse Play: host a web game</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"spatial bench\" href=\"/docs/guides/spatial-bench\" id=\"lnk-spatial-bench-2\">Spatial Bench</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"light and dark theme\" href=\"/docs/guides/light-and-dark-theme\" id=\"lnk-light-and-dark-theme-2\">Light and dark theme</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"share privately with tokens\" href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-2\">Share privately with tokens</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"show your clients who looked\" href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-show-your-clients-who-looked-2\">Show your clients who looked</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed anywhere: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" aria-current=\"page\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"verse-api-quickstart\">Verse API — Quickstart<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#verse-api-quickstart\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p>Everything Verse does is a plain HTTP API — the playground, the embed SDK, and the\nBlender, Unity and Unreal exporters are all clients of the same endpoints. Anything that can send\nan HTTP request (a game-engine plugin, a Blender add-on, a CI pipeline, curl) can\nturn a 3D file into a signed, streamed share link.</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Base URL:</strong> <code>https://verse.ctruh.com</code> (self-hosted: your origin)</li><li><strong>Postman collection:</strong> <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/verse-api.postman_collection.json\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-postman-collection-json\">/verse-api.postman_collection.json</a> — import and try every call</li><li><strong>Full reference:</strong> <a href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-docs-api-md\">docs/api.md</a> · Embed SDK: <a href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-docs-embed-sdk-md\">docs/embed-sdk.md</a> · JS/TS client: <a href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-docs-sdk-md\">docs/sdk.md</a> (<code>@ctruhtech/verse-sdk</code> — not on npm yet; build it from <code>sdk/</code> or load <code>/sdk/verse-sdk.js</code>)</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"authentication\">Authentication<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#authentication\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Two modes, set by the server operator:</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Open mode</strong> (no key file configured — current default): no auth header needed.\nUploads are rate-limited to <strong>6/hour per IP</strong> (<strong>20/hour</strong> per account\ntoken sent as <code>Authorization: Bearer</code>); publish endpoints (tour/poster/\nexperience) to 30/hour per IP. Files up to <strong>512 MB</strong>, or <strong>2 GB</strong> when\n<a href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-prepared\">prepared</a> and sent through the resumable\nupload; <code>GET /v1/limits</code> returns the live numbers.</li><li><strong>Keyed mode</strong>: send <code>X-Api-Key: &lt;your key&gt;</code> on uploads. Each key has a daily\nupload quota (default 512 MB/day). Bad or missing key → <code>401</code>; over quota → <code>429</code>.\nKeys are provisioned by the operator in <code>ingest/.verse-keys.json</code> (see\n<a href=\"/docs/api#authentication\" id=\"lnk-docs-api-md-2\">docs/api.md</a>).</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"the-core-flow-file-in-share-link-out\">The core flow: file in → share link out<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#the-core-flow-file-in-share-link-out\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<p><strong>1. Upload</strong> — POST the raw bytes (no multipart):</p>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"bash\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-bash\">curl -sS -X POST &quot;$BASE/v1/ingest&quot; \\\n  -H &quot;Content-Type: model/gltf-binary&quot; \\\n  -H &quot;X-Verse-Name: my-apartment&quot; \\\n  --data-binary @scene.glb\n# → 202 {&quot;job&quot;:&quot;my-apartment-1a2b3c4d5e6f&quot;}</code></pre></div>\n<p>Accepted inputs, auto-detected by magic bytes:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>You send</th><th>Detected as</th><th>Compiles to</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>.glb</code> (binary glTF; Draco + KTX2 supported)</td><td>mesh scene</td><td>streamed <code>.vpk</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>.ply</code> or <code>.splat</code> (Gaussian-splat capture)</td><td>splat</td><td>streamed <code>.vsp</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>.ply</code> (points), <code>.las</code> / <code>.laz</code>, <code>.e57</code>, <code>.xyz</code> / <code>.pts</code></td><td>point cloud</td><td>streamed point cloud</td></tr><tr><td><code>.ifc</code>, <code>.usdz</code> / <code>.usd*</code>, <code>.fbx</code>, <code>.obj</code> (alone or zipped with textures), PLY mesh</td><td>converted to GLB on the server</td><td>streamed <code>.vpk</code></td></tr><tr><td>a phone / LiDAR capture, a 3D tour export bundle&#39;s <code>.zip</code></td><td>scan (cleaned up first)</td><td>Fidelity or streamed — see <a href=\"/docs/scan-import\" id=\"lnk-import-a-scan-3\">Import a scan</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Force the kind for headerless formats with <code>X-Verse-Kind</code> (<code>splat</code>, <code>cloud</code>,\n<code>ifc</code>, <code>usd</code>, <code>fbx</code>, <code>obj</code>, <code>ply</code>); the full header list (bake, Fidelity\npath, look, scan, up axis, units) is in\n<a href=\"/docs/api#post-v1-ingest\" id=\"lnk-post-v1-ingest\"><code>POST /v1/ingest</code></a>.\n<code>X-Verse-Name</code> is optional (lowercase letters, digits, <code>-</code>, <code>_</code>); it prefixes the id.\nMax body: <strong>512 MB</strong> (20 GB for a prepared GLB through the resumable upload).</p>\n<p><strong>2. Poll</strong> the job until <code>done</code> (typical: ~8 s per source MB, floor 15 s — the\nrecord carries a live <code>stage</code> and <code>estimateS</code> so you can show honest progress):</p>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"bash\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy-2\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-bash\">curl -sS &quot;$BASE/v1/ingest/my-apartment-1a2b3c4d5e6f&quot;</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"json\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy-3\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-json\">{\n  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;done&quot;,\n  &quot;url&quot;:    &quot;https://…/?vpk=ingest/my-apartment-1a2b3c4d5e6f.vpk&quot;,\n  &quot;vpkUrl&quot;: &quot;https://…/ingest/my-apartment-1a2b3c4d5e6f.vpk&quot;,\n  &quot;stats&quot;:  { &quot;tris&quot;: 182340, &quot;clusters&quot;: 3271 },\n  &quot;signed&quot;: true\n}</code></pre></div>\n<p>While compiling you get <code>{&quot;status&quot;:&quot;compiling&quot;,&quot;stage&quot;:&quot;…&quot;,&quot;estimateS&quot;:…}</code>;\non failure <code>{&quot;status&quot;:&quot;error&quot;,&quot;error&quot;:&quot;…&quot;,&quot;errorInfo&quot;:{…}}</code>. Splat jobs return <code>vspUrl</code> and\n<code>stats: {splats, chunks}</code> instead. <code>signed: true</code> means the artifact carries an\nEd25519 signature the browser verifies against <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/v1/pubkey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"lnk-v1-pubkey\"><code>/v1/pubkey</code></a>.</p>\n<p><strong>3. Share.</strong> <code>url</code> is the ready-to-open walkthrough. Embed it with the SDK\n(<a href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-docs-embed-sdk-md-2\">docs/embed-sdk.md</a>) or an iframe. Scenes uploaded with an\naccount token are kept; anonymous ones are kept best-effort and the\nleast-recently-opened are removed when the server&#39;s disk budget fills\n(<a href=\"/docs/api#retention\" id=\"lnk-retention\">Retention</a>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"publishing-extras\">Publishing extras<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#publishing-extras\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Endpoint</th><th>Body</th><th>Returns</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>POST /v1/experience</code></td><td>JSON <code>{scene, …}</code> per <a href=\"/docs/experience-format\" id=\"lnk-experience-format\">experience-format</a>, ≤128 KB</td><td><code>{path, url}</code> — a <code>?experience=</code> link</td></tr><tr><td><code>POST /v1/tour</code></td><td>JSON <code>{scene, samples:[[t,x,y,z,fx,fy,fz]×2..6000]}</code>, ≤512 KB</td><td><code>{path, url}</code> — a <code>?tour=</code> link</td></tr><tr><td><code>POST /v1/poster</code></td><td>raw PNG, ≤4 MB</td><td><code>{path, url}</code> — a poster image URL</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"live-presence-shared-tours\">Live presence (shared tours)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#live-presence-shared-tours\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><code>GET /v1/room/&lt;id&gt;/events</code> — Server-Sent Events roster stream (<code>id</code> = <code>[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64}</code>).</li><li><code>POST /v1/room/&lt;id&gt;/pose</code> — JSON <code>{id, name, color:&quot;#rrggbb&quot;, pose:[x,y,z,fx,fy,fz]}</code> ≤2 KB, ~8 Hz.\nPeers expire after 10 s of silence; 32 peers per room. Rooms are ephemeral,\nin-memory, unauthenticated — treat room ids as capability URLs.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"large-files-resumable-upload\">Large files: resumable upload<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#large-files-resumable-upload\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Above ~100 MB, use the resumable flow so an edge hiccup resumes instead of\nrestarting: <code>POST /v1/ingest/begin {size, name}</code> → <code>{uploadId}</code>, ordered\n<code>PUT /v1/ingest/part/&lt;uploadId&gt;</code> with <code>Content-Range</code>, then\n<code>POST /v1/ingest/commit/&lt;uploadId&gt;</code> → the same <code>202 {job}</code>. An out-of-order\npart answers <code>409</code> with the server&#39;s <code>received</code> offset to resume from.\nDetails: <a href=\"/docs/api#resumable-uploads\" id=\"lnk-resumable-uploads\">Resumable uploads</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"own-protect-review\">Own, protect, review<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#own-protect-review\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-7\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><code>POST /v1/account {name}</code> → a token (shown once) that owns what you upload\nwith <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code>: permanent scenes, <code>/studio</code>, analytics.</li><li><code>PATCH /v1/scenes/&lt;id&gt; {&quot;visibility&quot;:&quot;private&quot;}</code> + <code>POST /v1/scenes/&lt;id&gt;/share</code>\n→ per-recipient share tokens; <code>?share=&lt;token&gt;</code> on the link.\n<a href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-guide\">Guide</a>.</li><li><code>POST /v1/review/&lt;id&gt; {pos, text}</code> / <code>GET /v1/review/&lt;id&gt;</code> — comments\npinned in 3D on the shared scene. <a href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-guide-2\">Guide</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"errors\">Errors<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#errors\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-8\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Every error the app generates is JSON <code>{&quot;error&quot;:&quot;…&quot;}</code> with a real status\n<strong>and the header <code>X-Verse-Error: 1</code></strong>: <code>401</code> unknown key, <code>404</code> unknown job,\n<code>409</code> out-of-order part, <code>413</code> body too large, <code>429</code> rate/quota, <code>503</code> compile\nqueue full, <code>507</code> storage full. An error <strong>without</strong> the header came from the\nnetwork edge, not the app — that one is worth a retry. Back off on <code>429</code>/<code>503</code>;\nre-upload on <code>error</code>. Full rule: <a href=\"/docs/api#error-contract\" id=\"lnk-error-contract\">Error contract</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"building-a-plugin-blender-unity-unreal\">Building a plugin (Blender / Unity / Unreal)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#building-a-plugin-blender-unity-unreal\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-9\">#</a></h2>\n<p>An exporter needs exactly three calls: export the scene to GLB, <code>POST\n/v1/ingest</code> (or the resumable trio), poll <code>GET /v1/ingest/&lt;job&gt;</code>, then hand\nthe user the <code>url</code>. The shipped integrations are the reference\nimplementations: <code>integrations/blender/verse_publish</code> (Extensions add-on,\nstdlib-only, verified in Blender 5.0.1), <code>integrations/unity/com.ctruh.verse-publish</code>\n(UPM package, verified in Unity 6000.6.5f1) and <code>integrations/unreal/VersePublish</code>\n(editor plugin, verified in Unreal Engine 5.8.3). Each has a README and a how-to guide; the server URL is configurable,\nso they work against the hosted service or a self-hosted origin identically.\nMinimal single-file protocol examples remain under <code>tools/verselink-*</code>.</p></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#authentication\" id=\"lnk-authentication\">Authentication</a><a href=\"#the-core-flow-file-in-share-link-out\" id=\"lnk-the-core-flow-file-in-share-link-out\">The core flow: file in → share link out</a><a href=\"#publishing-extras\" id=\"lnk-publishing-extras\">Publishing extras</a><a href=\"#live-presence-shared-tours\" id=\"lnk-live-presence-shared-tours\">Live presence (shared tours)</a><a href=\"#large-files-resumable-upload\" id=\"lnk-large-files-resumable-upload\">Large files: resumable upload</a><a href=\"#own-protect-review\" id=\"lnk-own-protect-review\">Own, protect, review</a><a href=\"#errors\" id=\"lnk-errors\">Errors</a><a href=\"#building-a-plugin-blender-unity-unreal\" id=\"lnk-building-a-plugin-blender-unity-unreal\">Building a plugin (Blender / Unity / Unreal)</a></aside></section>"}